Preview disconnecting one wireless client

Usage:
  olr devices show operation <id> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help            help for operation
      --mac string      Wireless client MAC address
      --target string   Wireless network interface to target

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
